cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "smartcell: a SO-101 conveyor pick-and-place research artifact"
abstract: >-
  A MuJoCo work cell where a SO-101 arm picks a 32 mm part from a
  continuously running conveyor and places it in a tote. The controller is a
  frozen grayscale behaviour-cloning policy plus a classical RGB wrist visual
  servo and a proprioceptive release primitive. Includes a zero-shot
  benchmark in a Blender-dressed scene.
authors:
